Speaker model

3dspeaker_eres2net_en_voxceleb_16k.onnx is the ERes2Net speaker verification
model (English, trained on VoxCeleb) from the 3D-Speaker project by Alibaba
Tongyi Lab (ModelScope model iic/speech_eres2net_sv_en_voxceleb_16k), in the
ONNX packaging published by the sherpa-onnx project:
https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/tag/speaker-recongition-models

It is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The file is not stored in this repository. The Docker build downloads it and
verifies its SHA-256 (scripts/fetch-speaker-model.mjs):
c59158379255ad66e161679cca6af8d52d51e389e3224ab7d7a7baae295c2db5
